OL,3,GNEWSAHealey delivered 'scattergun'
OL,4,ABudget that failed to tackle UK's
OL,5,Achallenges, think tank says
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey delivered a
OL,8,F"scattergun" Budget that failed to
OL,9,Ftackle UK's challenges, a think tank
OL,10,Fsays
OL,12,FThe Resolution Foundation, which
OL,13,Ffocuses on lower and middle earners,
OL,14,Fsays cost of living support is being
OL,15,Fspread "far too thinly"
OL,17,FHealey delivered his first Budget as
OL,18,Fchancellor on Wednesday - he tells the
OL,19,FBBC the government "can never remove
OL,20,Fcompletely the cost of living pressures
OL,21,Fthat people feel"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
